OL,3,GNEWSACocaine gang busted after party
OL,4,Agot too wild
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gang of cocaine dealers was busted
OL,7,Fafter a house party got too wild, a
OL,8,Fcourt has heard.
OL,10,FPolice found up to #15,400 worth of the
OL,11,FClass A drug and more than #7,000 in
OL,12,Fcash hidden in a biscuit tin when they
OL,13,Fwent to break up an "out of control"
OL,14,Fgathering in Sunderland in August 2023,
OL,15,FNewcastle Crown Court heard.
OL,17,FFour people have already been sentenced
OL,18,Fwith runner Katie James, 37, the final
OL,19,Fone to be dealt with.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
